## 2. Cross-sectional Forecasting Performance

- **IC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0641, std = 0.1324, ICIR = 0.48, HAC t-stat = 8.1 (lags=5)
- **RankIC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0720, std = 0.1312, IR = 0.55, HAC t-stat = 9.1 (lags=5)
